[{"title":"望邳州","author":"文天祥","text":"中原行几日，今日才见山。\n问山在何处，云在徐邳间。\n邳州山，徐州水，项籍不还韩信死。\n龙争虎斗不肯止，烟草漫漫青万里。\n古来刘季号英雄，樊崇至今已千岁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6335,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅 其一","author":"文天祥","text":"梅花耐寒白如玉，干涉春风红更黄。\n若为司花示薄罚，到底不能磨灭香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6336,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅州第六十六","author":"文天祥","text":"楼角凌风迥，孤城隐雾深。\n万事随转烛，秋光近青岑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6337,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"淮安军","author":"文天祥","text":"楚州城门外，白杨吹悲风。\n累累死人冢，死向锋镝中。\n岂无匹妇冤，定无万夫雄。\n中原在其北，登城望何穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6338,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"淮西帅第二十五","author":"文天祥","text":"借问大将谁，战骨当速朽。\n逆节同所归，水花笑白首。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6339,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清江何汉英再见于空同读欧阳先生诗感慨为赋","author":"文天祥","text":"采芝云满山，采檗瀑垂涧。\n当年有清徽，为寄南来雁。\n雁去人已逝，岁月剨云晏。\n流水失声音，西河老忧患。\n往日志士悲，穷途行子惯。\n君为梁宋游，我复江汉宦。\n十年耿相逢，千里欠一盼。\n玄机寄糟粕，美疢堕刍豢。\n赠子归东方，聊荐吴兴苋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6340,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"理宗度宗第二","author":"文天祥","text":"先帝弓剑远，永怀侍芳茵。\n今朝汉社稷，为话涕沾巾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6341,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"移司即事","author":"文天祥","text":"燕山积雨泥塞道，大屋攲倾小成倒。\n赭衣棘下无颜色，仓卒移司避流潦。\n行行桎梏如贯鱼，怜我龙钟迟明早。\n我来二十有一月，若书下下几一考。\n梦回恍忆入新衙，不知传舍何时了。\n寄书痴儿了家事，九牛一毛亦云小。\n天门皇皇虎豹立，下土孤臣泣云表。\n莫令赤子尽为鱼，早愿当空日杲杲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6342,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百七十","author":"文天祥","text":"天长眺东南，衰谢多酸辛。\n丈夫誓许国，直笔在史臣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6343,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百七十七","author":"文天祥","text":"男儿生世间，居然成濩落。\n鸾凤有铩翮，虹蜺就掌握。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6344,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百七十九","author":"文天祥","text":"威凤高其翔，老鹤万里心。\n脱略谁能驯，兀兀遂至今。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6345,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百七十二","author":"文天祥","text":"济时肯杀身，惨淡苦士志。\n百年能几何，终古立忠义。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6346,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百七十六","author":"文天祥","text":"天地日蛙黾，劳生苦柰何。\n聊欲从此逝，人少豺虎多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6347,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百九十","author":"文天祥","text":"万古一死生，谁是长年者。\n我何良叹嗟，短褐即长夜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6348,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百九十一","author":"文天祥","text":"高官何足论，寂寞身后事。\n物理固自然，愿闻第一义。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6349,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百九十七","author":"文天祥","text":"关河霜雪清，故人亦流落。\n夷歌奉玉盘，悲君随燕雀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6350,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百九十九","author":"文天祥","text":"南北逃世难，始闻蕃汉殊。\n天下今一家，中原有驱除。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6351,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百九十八","author":"文天祥","text":"渔阳豪侠地，北里富熏天。\n快马金缠辔，但遇新少年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6352,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百九十三","author":"文天祥","text":"蝮蛇暮偃蹇，猛虎凭其威。\n真宰意茫茫，六合人烟稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6353,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百九十五","author":"文天祥","text":"眼中万少年，得志行所为。\n白马蹴微雪，追随燕蓟儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6354,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百九十六","author":"文天祥","text":"客从何乡来，挟矢射汉月。\n杀身傍权要，门户有旌节。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6355,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百九十四","author":"文天祥","text":"黎民困逆节，残孽驻艰虞。\n孰云网恢恢，自及枭獍徒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6356,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百八十","author":"文天祥","text":"天寒霜雪繁，萧萧北风劲。\n高鸟黄云暮，斗上捩孤影。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6357,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百八十一","author":"文天祥","text":"乾坤沸嗷嗷，名系朱鸟影。\n寥落寸心违，斯文亦吾病。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6358,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百八十八","author":"文天祥","text":"茫然阮籍途，益叹身世拙。\n零落蛟龙匣，开视化为血。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6359,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百八十三","author":"文天祥","text":"名贤慎出处，志士怀感伤。\n犹残数行泪，引古惜兴亡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6360,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百八十五","author":"文天祥","text":"萧条四海内，慷慨有馀悲。\n路逢相识人，开怀无愧辞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6361,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百八十四","author":"文天祥","text":"读书破万卷，许身一何愚。\n赤骥顿长缨，健儿胜腐儒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6362,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百五十七","author":"文天祥","text":"江汉故人少，东西消息稀。\n异花开绝域，野风吹征衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6363,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百五十九","author":"文天祥","text":"人生无家别，亲故伤老丑。\n剪纸招我魂，何时一樽酒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6364,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百五十八","author":"文天祥","text":"老夫悲暮年，天涯故人少。\n每望东南云，决眦入归鸟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6365,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百六十一","author":"文天祥","text":"迢迢万里馀，绝域谁慰怀。\n我圃日苍翠，回首望两崖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6366,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百六十七","author":"文天祥","text":"阴风千里来，惊浪满吴楚。\n世事两茫茫，飘泊欲谁诉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6367,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百六十九","author":"文天祥","text":"今吾抱何恨，恨无匡复姿。\n含笑看吴钩，回首蛟龙池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6368,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百六十二","author":"文天祥","text":"春日涨云岑，故园当北斗。\n窈窕桃李花，纷披为谁秀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6369,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百六十八","author":"文天祥","text":"平生方寸心，誓开玄冥北。\n岁暮日月疾，我叹黑头白。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6370,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第一百六十三","author":"文天祥","text":"陶潜避俗翁，庞公竟独往。\n明明君臣契，牢落吾安放。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6371,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"第二百","author":"文天祥","text":"茫茫天造间，高岸尚为谷。\n百川日东流，势阅人代速。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6372,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"脱京口 出门难","author":"文天祥","text":"罗刹盈庭夜色寒，人家灯火半阑珊。\n梦回跳出铁门限，世上一重人鬼关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6373,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"萧从事焘夫第一百二十三","author":"文天祥","text":"洒翰银钩连，翩跹山颠鹤。\n惨淡斗龙蛇，及兹叹冥漠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6374,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"萧架阁第一百二十四","author":"文天祥","text":"诸生旧短褐，张目视寇雠。\n高义终焉在，白骨更何忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6375,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"萧资第一百三十一","author":"文天祥","text":"主当风云会，谢尔从者劳。\n感恩义不小，块独委蓬蒿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6376,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄州第七","author":"文天祥","text":"桓桓陈将军，东屯大江北。\n化作虎与豺，楚星南天黑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6377,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"彭司令震龙第一百二十二","author":"文天祥","text":"堂上会亲戚，可怜马上郎。\n呻吟更流血，干戈浩茫茫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6378,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"彭城行","author":"文天祥","text":"连山四围合，吕梁贯其中。\n河南大都会，故有项王宫。\n晋牧连杨豫，虎视北方雄。\n唐时燕子楼，风流张建封。\n西望睢阳城，只与汴水通。\n太平黄楼赋，尚能想遗风。\n迩来百馀年，正朔归江东。\n遗民死欲尽，莽然狐兔丛。\n我从南方来，停骖抚遗踪。\n故河蓄潢潦，荒城翳秋蓬。\n凄凉戏马台，憔悴巨佛峰。\n沧海变桑田，陵谷代不同。\n朝为朱门贵，暮作行旅穷。\n乘除信物理，感慨系所逢。\n古来贤达人，一醉万虑空。\n如此独醒何，悲风逐征鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6379,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"彭通伯卫和堂","author":"文天祥","text":"理身如理国，用药如用兵。\n人能保天和，于身为太平。\n外邪奸其间，甚于寇抢攘。\n守护一不谨，乘间敌益勍。\n古有黄帝书，犹今六韬经。\n悍夫命雄喙，仁将资参苓。\n羽衣为其徒，识破阴阳争。\n指授别生死，铮然震能名。\n道家摄铅汞，肤腠如重扃。\n到头关键密，六气无敢婴。\n君方建旗鼓，不敢走且惊。\n他时櫜吾弓，闭门读黄庭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6380,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"景炎拥立第二十八","author":"文天祥","text":"汉运初中兴，扶颠待柱石。\n畴能补天漏，登阶捧玉册。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6381,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"景炎宾天第三十一","author":"文天祥","text":"阴风西北来，青海天轩轾。\n白水暮东流，魂断苍梧帝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6382,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暑布送王廷举用萧敬夫韵 其二","author":"文天祥","text":"高人不烟火，跳出天地窑。\n掀然立千仞，块视金与焦。\n香袂拂雪冷，紫髯逐风飘。\n摩挲云冥树，岂随群卉凋。\n但知仙骨轻，不学倒影摇。\n人间尽描貌，妙不在生绡。\n揭斗斟天浆，霞衣却琼瑶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6383,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"暑布送王廷举用萧敬夫韵 其一","author":"文天祥","text":"平生凉薄资，埏陶误大窑。\n谁知此石怪，愈沃乃愈焦。\n昆崙织火鼠，顿易鹑衣飘。\n荣我丝萝附，免此蒲柳凋。\n服之雪漫白，长袂风摇摇。\n表之以雾縠，缘之以烟绡。\n振衣从姬满，佩玉游西瑶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6384,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"曾先生第一百三十六","author":"文天祥","text":"江海日凄凉，贤圣尽萧索。\n西河共风味，顾步涕横落。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6385,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渡瓜洲 其一","author":"文天祥","text":"跨江半壁阅千帆，虎在深山龙在潭。\n当日本为南制北，如今翻被北持南。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6386,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渡江第十","author":"文天祥","text":"济江元自阔，轻舟下吴会。\n南纪改波澜，吾将罪真宰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6387,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湘潭道中赠丁碧眼相士 其一","author":"文天祥","text":"自诡衡山道士孙，至今句法有轩辕。\n世人未见题尧庙，尽把昌黎作寓言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6388,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"筑房子歌","author":"文天祥","text":"自予居狴犴，一室以自治。\n二年二大雨，地污实成池。\n圄人为我恻，畚土以筑之。\n筑之可二尺，宛然水中坻。\n初运朽壤来，臭秽恨莫追。\n掩鼻不可近，牛皂鸡于埘。\n须臾传黑坟，千杵鸣参差。\n但见如坻平，粪土不复疑。\n乃知天下事，不在论镃基。\n苟可掩耳目，臭腐誇神奇。\n世人所不辨，羊质而虎皮。\n大者莫不然，小者又何知。\n深居守我玄，默观道推移。\n何时蝉蜕去，忽与浊世违。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6389,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"葬无主墓碑","author":"文天祥","text":"路逢一石碑，亭亭傲风雨。\n停骖彷佛看，云是无主墓。\n末书戊申岁，屈指九十秋。\n是时龙渡江，甲子恍一周。\n借问葬者谁，承平百世祖。\n亦有周馀民，战骨委黄土。\n太祖下江南，誓不戮一人。\n神孙再立国，天以报至仁。\n大河流血丹，屠毒谁之罪。\n潼关忽不守，皇皇依汴蔡。\n螳螂知捕蝉，不知黄雀来。\n今古有兴废，重为生人哀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6390,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遇灵阳子谈道赠以诗","author":"文天祥","text":"昔我爱泉石，长揖离公卿。\n结屋青山下，咫尺蓬与瀛。\n至人不可见，世尘忽相缨。\n业风吹浩劫，蜗角争浮名。\n偶逢大吕翁，如有宿世盟。\n相从语寥廓，俯仰万念轻。\n天地不知老，日月交其精。\n人一阴阳性，本来自长生。\n指点虚无间，引我归员明。\n一针透顶门，道骨由天成。\n我如一逆旅，久欲蹑屩行。\n闻师此妙诀，蘧庐复何情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6391,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鲁港之遁第十四","author":"文天祥","text":"出师亦多门，水陆迷畏途。\n蹭蹬麒麟老，危樯逐夜乌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6392,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"勤王第五十三","author":"文天祥","text":"出师亘长云，尽驱诣阙下。\n首唱恢大义，垂之俟来者。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6393,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新济州","author":"文天祥","text":"借问新济州，徐郓兄弟国。\n昔为大河南，今为大河北。\n垂云阴万里，平原望不极。\n百草尽枯死，黄花自秋色。\n时时见桑树，青青杂阡陌。\n路上无人行，烟火渺萧瑟。\n车辙分纵横，过者临岐泣。\n积潦流交衢，霜蹄破丛棘。\n江南寒未深，铜炉兽花赤。\n为知行路人，铁冷衣裳湿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6394,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"献州道中","author":"文天祥","text":"三年戎服行，五岭文玉会。\n跻攀上崖磴，厉揭涉潇濑。\n十步九崎岖，山水何破碎。\n坐令管仲小，自觉伯夷隘。\n乃今来中州，万里如一概。\n四望登原隰，桑麻蔚旆旆。\n骅骝出清庙，过都真历块。\n历历古战场，俯仰生感慨。\n吾常涉重湖，东海际南海。\n兹游冠平生，天宇更宏大。\n心与太虚际，目空九围内。\n男儿不出居，妇人坐帷盖。\n反身以自观，须弥纳一芥。\n以此处死生，超然万形内。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6395,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"福安府第二十九","author":"文天祥","text":"崔嵬扶桑日，阔会沧海潮。\n倾都看黄屋，此意竟萧条。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6396,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"福安宰相第六十三","author":"文天祥","text":"纷然丧乱际，反覆归圣朝。\n秉钧孰为偶，扶颠永萧条。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6397,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舅第一百四十二","author":"文天祥","text":"萱草秋已死，岁暮有严霜。\n落日渭阳明，涕泪溅我裳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6398,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"歌风台","author":"文天祥","text":"长陵有神气，万岁光如虹。\n有时风雪变，魂魄来沛宫。\n壮哉游子乡，一览万宇空。\n击筑戒复隍，帝业慎所终。\n重瞳爱梁父，此情岂不同。\n锦衣绚行昼，丈夫何浅中。\n缅怀首丘意，自足分雌雄。\n尚惜霸心存，慷慨怀勇功。\n不见往来事，烹狗与藏弓。\n早知致两生，礼乐三代隆。\n匹夫事已往，安用责乃翁。\n我来汤沐邑，白杨吹悲风。\n永言三侯章，隐隐闻儿童。\n叶落皆归根，飘零独秋蓬。\n登台共悽恻，目送南飞鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6399,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"端午","author":"文天祥","text":"五月五日午，薰风自南至。\n试为问大钧，举杯三酹地。\n田文当日生，屈原当日死。\n生为薛城君，死作汨罗鬼。\n高堂狐兔游，雍门发悲涕。\n人命草头露，荣华风过耳。\n唯有烈士心，不随水俱逝。\n至今荆楚人，江上年年祭。\n不知生者荣，但知死者贵。\n勿谓死可憎，勿谓生可喜。\n万物皆有尽，不灭唯天理。\n百年如一日，一日或千岁。\n秋风汾水辞，春暮兰亭记。\n莫作留连悲，高歌舞槐翠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6400,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"端午初度 其一","author":"文天祥","text":"死所初何怨，生朝只自知。\n颇怀常杕意，忍诵蓼莪诗。\n浮世百年梦，高人千载期。\n楚囚一杯水，胜似九霞卮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6401,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"端午即事","author":"文天祥","text":"五月五日午，赠我一枝艾。\n故人不可见，新知万里外。\n丹心照夙昔，鬓发日已改。\n我欲从灵均，三湘隔辽海。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6402,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"缪朝宗第一百一十六","author":"文天祥","text":"空荒咆熊罴，摧残没藜莠。\n平生江海心，其人骨已朽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6403,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酹江月 其二 驿中言别友人","author":"文天祥","text":"水天空阔，恨东风、不借世间英物。\n蜀鸟吴花残照里，忍见荒城颓壁。\n铜雀春情，金人秋泪，此恨凭谁雪？\n堂堂剑气，斗牛空认奇杰。\n那信江海余生，南行万里，属扁舟齐发。\n正为鸥盟留醉眼，细看涛生云灭。\n睨柱吞嬴，回旗走懿，千古冲冠发。\n伴人无寐，秦淮应是孤月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6404,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]